     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The number of games in a single round-robin tournament with <i>n</i> teams is <span data-math=\"\\frac{{n\\left( {n - 1} \\right)}}{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><i>n</i>: 12 teams</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{n\\left( {n - 1} \\right)}}{2} = \\frac{{12\\left( {12 - 1} \\right)}}{2} = \\frac{{12\\left( {11} \\right)}}{2} = \\frac{{132}}{2} = 66\"></span></p>\n<p>There are 66 games.</p>"
