     "content_html": "<p>The number of games in a single round-robin tournament with <i>n</i> teams is <span data-math=\"\\frac{{n\\left( {n - 1} \\right)}}{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><i>n</i>: 25 teams</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{n\\left( {n - 1} \\right)}}{2} = \\frac{{25\\left( {25 - 1} \\right)}}{2} = \\frac{{25\\left( {24} \\right)}}{2} = \\frac{{600}}{2} = 300\"></span></p>\n<p>There are 300 games.</p>"
